#: hakubun/ui/qt/settings.py:261 hakubun/ui/gtk/data/settingswindow.ui:363
msgid "Only applies when the player above is mpv. Hands off playback to the already-running mpv window via its IPC socket instead of starting a new process each time."
msgstr "仅当上面的播放器是 mpv 时适用。通过其 IPC 套接字将播放交给已在运行的 mpv 窗口，而不是每次都启动新进程。"

#: hakubun/ui/qt/settings.py:264
