#: hakubun/ui/qt/settings.py:494 hakubun/ui/gtk/data/settingswindow.ui:2438
msgid "Which Kitsu API to use for Kitsu accounts. Takes effect the next time the account is loaded. Both use the same Kitsu login."
msgstr "Kitsu 账户使用哪个 Kitsu API。将在下次加载账户时生效。两者使用相同的 Kitsu 登录信息。"

