#: hakubun/ui/qt/settings.py:584 hakubun/ui/gtk/data/settingswindow.ui:2127
msgid "Automatically cross-references MyAnimeList's community score for shows on your list after every sync, using a MyAnimeList account added in Hakubun+. Not needed if this account already is MyAnimeList."
msgstr "每次同步后自动使用已添加到 Hakubun+ 的 MyAnimeList 账户，交叉核对你列表中作品的 MyAnimeList 社区评分。如果此账户本身就是 MyAnimeList，则不需要此项。"

#: hakubun/ui/qt/settings.py:588 hakubun/ui/gtk/data/settingswindow.ui:2137
msgid "Load MAL Scores Now"
msgstr "立即加载 MAL 评分"

#: hakubun/ui/qt/settings.py:590 hakubun/ui/gtk/data/settingswindow.ui:2142
msgid "Fetch MAL scores for the current list right now, without waiting for a sync or enabling the automatic option above."
msgstr "立即获取当前列表的 MAL 评分，无需等待同步或启用上面的自动选项。"

#: hakubun/ui/qt/settings.py:600 hakubun/ui/gtk/data/window.ui:71
